        <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M22 6l-10 7L2 6"/></svg>Codice subito via email</span>
